' Aus test_modules_html.py uebertragen (17 Faelle, aufgezeichnet 2026-09-08). Format: docs/werkzeuge.md, dhrt test.

=== http get invalid url raises
IMPORT "html"
PRINT HTTP_GET("not-a-url")
--- fehler
HTTP-Fehler: Bad URL: failed to parse URL: RelativeUrlWithoutBase: relative URL without a base - not-a-url

=== url encode special chars
IMPORT "html"
PRINT URL_ENCODE("Hallo Welt!")
--- erwartet
Hallo%20Welt%21

=== url encode decode roundtrip
IMPORT "html"
PRINT URL_DECODE(URL_ENCODE("ä?&=#/+ space"))
--- erwartet
ä?&=#/+ space

=== html text strips tags
IMPORT "html"
PRINT HTML_TEXT("<p>Hallo <b>Welt</b></p>")
--- erwartet
Hallo Welt

=== html text decodes entities
IMPORT "html"
PRINT HTML_TEXT("<p>5 &lt; 10 &amp; ok</p>")
--- erwartet
5 < 10 & ok

=== html text comment with gt does not leak into text
IMPORT "html"
PRINT HTML_TEXT("<p>vorher</p><!-- if (x>1) then y --><p>nachher</p>")
--- erwartet
vorher
nachher

=== html text skips script and style
IMPORT "html"
PRINT HTML_TEXT("<html><head><style>body { color: red; }</style><script>alert('hi')</script></head><body>Sichtbarer Text</body></html>")
--- erwartet
Sichtbarer Text

=== find all simple tags
IMPORT "html"
DIM a AS ARRAY OF STRING
a = HTML_FIND_ALL("<a href=""x"">eins</a> Filler <a>zwei</a>", "a")
PRINT LEN(a)
PRINT a[0]
PRINT a[1]
--- erwartet
2
eins
zwei

